{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15216090","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15216090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:0:1521609001:0":{"text":"마력을 주입하자 눈앞에 누군가의 기억이 떠오르기 시작했다...","source_cn":"随着魔力的注入，你眼前出现了一段记忆……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4061919BFB5E9EE5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마력을 주입하자 눈앞에 누군가의 기억이 떠오르기 시작했다...","female":"마력을 주입하자 눈앞에 누군가의 기억이 떠오르기 시작했다...","variant_male_record_index":"184557","variant_female_record_index":"184558","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521609002:0":{"text":"자, 이걸 가져가거라.","source_cn":"喏，拿好这个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3FD0DC5C71C65AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:5::0":{"text":"원색 조각상","source_cn":"原色石雕","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC58CAA4AC76C35D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1521609003:0":{"text":"아버지, 또 뭘 가져오신 거예요? 이미 아버지가 주신 물건이 한가득이라고요!","source_cn":"老爹，你又拿了什么啊？你都给我塞了好多行李了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDCBFA58695166AE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1521609004:0":{"text":"이 녀석, 말하는 것 좀 봐라. 아빠가 그렇게 마음에 안 들더냐?","source_cn":"哟，瞧你那样，还嫌弃上你老爹我了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A15E08CEE838093","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1521609005:1":{"text":"가져가! 수호상이다.","source_cn":"拿着！这是守护像。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1939357CFA8B2807","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1521609006:0":{"text":"이틀 밤을 꼬박 새워 만든 수호상이야. 항상 가지고 다니고, 절대로 잊어버리지 말거라!","source_cn":"你老爹我熬了两个通宵才做好，给我好好带上，不许弄丢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5458D19C5443FC9D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1521609007:1":{"text":"네네, 알겠어요. 절대 안 잃어버릴게요.","source_cn":"好好好，我知道，肯定丢不了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39BD318F29BC222C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1521609008:1":{"text":"그럼 저 갈게요.","source_cn":"那我走了啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC98E559C42EBF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1521609009:1":{"text":"엄마가 돌아올 때까지 기다렸다가, 같이 밥이나 먹고 가지 그래?","source_cn":"不等你老娘回来吃顿饭吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA40E613D4D389B40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1521609010:0":{"text":"시간 없어요. 다른 사람의 마차를 같이 타고 가기로 했단 말이에요. 약속 시간이 지금이라서 더는 미룰 수가 없어요.","source_cn":"不了。我搭别人的马车，说好的就是这个时间，不能再拖了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD2DAA1B7423C2ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1521609011:0":{"text":"갈게요! 편지 꼭 쓸게요!","source_cn":"走了！我会记得给你们写信的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD84E0FF2D1605DBC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1521609012:0":{"text":"녀석...","source_cn":"这孩子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E553A00C1C9628D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1521609013:0":{"text":"이렇게나 자그마한 석상을 만드는 데 이틀이나 걸렸다고?","source_cn":"就那么个小石像，居然还花了你两天时间？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x680AB1ABC3D2F312","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1521609014:0":{"text":"스톤아트, 손재주가 예전만도 못한 거 아니야? 이대로 가다간 가게도 곧 문을 닫겠어.","source_cn":"老石艺，你手艺是不是退步了啊？这么干下去，铺子迟早得黄吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD98428B059857D7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1521609015:0":{"text":"아들한테 주는 건데, 시간이 조금 더 걸리면 뭐 어때? 납품 일정에 지장이 가는 것도 아니잖아.","source_cn":"那不是送给我儿子的吗，多花点时间怎么了，又不会耽误工期。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39EC1034228C99B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1521609016:0":{"text":"저기에 있는 큰 돌덩이 보이지? 이번에 누가 분수대를 주문했거든. 이게 바로 진짜 큰 건이지!","source_cn":"喏，看到那边的大石头了吗？这次人家找我订了一个喷泉，这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8066A572E70D7880","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:22:1521609017:0":{"text":"메아리 공명으로 재생되던 기억이 멈추었고, 두 사람의 말소리는 더 이상 들리지 않았다","source_cn":"回响共鸣出的记忆片段到此为止，后续两人的耳语你再听不到了","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x20DDFD4383D86F0D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"메아리 공명으로 재생되던 기억이 멈추었고, 두 사람의 말소리는 더 이상 들리지 않았다","female":"메아리 공명으로 재생되던 기억이 멈추었고, 두 사람의 말소리는 더 이상 들리지 않았다","variant_male_record_index":"184576","variant_female_record_index":"184577","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"블랙 스크린 자막","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:老石艺":{"text":"스톤아트","source":"老石艺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:维尔纳":{"text":"베르너","source":"维尔纳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:鲁苏斯":{"text":"루수스","source":"鲁苏斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":4}}